おかわりならもう欲しい 愛包ダンスホール
I already want seconds, Ai-pai Dance Hall!

120
00:14:11,516 --> 00:14:15,516
どうぞ
Here you go.

121
00:14:15,516 --> 00:14:20,016
愛包ダンスホール 今日はボレロ
Ai-pai Dance Hall, today's a bolero

122
00:14:20,016 --> 00:14:24,016
蕩けった少年 甘酸っぱい感情 求愛人類 パイ 満杯
Melted boy, bittersweet emotion, soliciting humanity, pie is full

123
00:14:24,016 --> 00:14:28,016
オーブントースターは漏れ漏れよ
The toaster is leaking

124
00:14:28,016 --> 00:14:32,516
おかわりはアンコール次第ね
Seconds depend on the encore

125
00:14:32,516 --> 00:14:36,516
オワラナイ・ラブコール・ノ・ダンス・デ
Endless love call dance

126
00:14:36,516 --> 00:14:41,016
愛包ダンスホール
Ai-pai Dance Hall

127
00:14:41,016 --> 00:14:45,516
おかわりならもう欲しい
I already want seconds

128
00:14:45,516 --> 00:14:50,016
愛包ダンスホール
Ai-pai Dance Hall

129
00:14:50,016 --> 00:14:54,016
割り切れない気持ち抱えてるよ
I'm holding onto feelings that can't be divided.

130
00:14:54,016 --> 00:15:00,040
ロボ人も幻人も猿人も円陣組んで仲良くやれたらとか
If robot-people, illusion-people, and ape-people could form a circle and get along nicely, or something

131
00:15:04,779 --> 00:15:11,859
僕等が生まれて初めて知る音は心臓の鼓動だろ
The very first sound we ever know is the heartbeat of our hearts...

132
00:15:12,439 --> 00:15:14,679
トトン トトン タトン タトン タテン タトンタ
Ton-ton, ton-ton, ta-ton, ta-ton, ta-ten, ta-ton-ta!

133
00:15:15,179 --> 00:15:18,199
それはリズムと知った
We learned that it was a rhythm.

134
00:15:18,199 --> 00:15:20,219
いにしえもいまどきも
From ancient times to the modern day,

135
00:15:20,219 --> 00:15:24,459
パイ beat が僕達を包んで繋いでんだろ？
Doesn't the pie beat wrap around and connect us all?

136
00:15:25,139 --> 00:15:29,159
パパッパッパッパパイ パイ！？ 愛包！愛いっぱいで惚れ惚れよ
Pa-pa-pa-pa-pie, pie!? Ai-pai! So full of love, it's mesmerizing!

137
00:15:29,859 --> 00:15:33,939
蕩けった少年 甘酸っぱい感情 求愛人類 パイ 満杯だい
Melting boys, bittersweet emotions, courting humanity, pies are overflowing!

138
00:15:33,939 --> 00:15:37,079
完敗！完全に惚れ惚れよ
Total defeat! Completely mesmerizing!

139
00:15:39,136 --> 00:15:46,456
ララララララララララ まるでバージンロードで踊ってるみたい 生まれ変わった様な気分でして
La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la-la, feeling like we're walking down the wedding aisle, like we've been reborn...

140
00:15:47,136 --> 00:15:50,076
乾杯ね 今日はボレロ
Cheers, today is a bolero!

141
00:15:50,076 --> 00:15:54,516
交わって人類 馬鹿んなって笑っ照れ
Intermingling humanity, acting like fools and laughing bashfully...

142
00:15:54,696 --> 00:16:00,696
終わらないπの様に続けりゃいい 計算なんてできないが！
We should just keep going like an endless pi, even if we can't calculate it!

143
00:16:00,696 --> 00:16:05,176
愛いっぱい！
So full of love!

144
00:16:07,176 --> 00:16:14,676
愛包ダンスホール 今日はボレロ 蕩けった少年 甘酸っぱい感情 求愛人類 パイ は満杯さ
Ai-pai Dance Hall, today is a bolero. Melting boys, bittersweet emotions, courting humanity, pies are overflowing!

145
00:16:15,176 --> 00:16:19,516
また食べに来てね あなたならいつでもいいよ
Come back and eat again, anytime is fine for you!

146
00:16:20,176 --> 00:16:21,416
おかわり欲しいでしょ？
You want seconds, right?

147
00:16:26,524 --> 00:16:35,024
愛包ダンスホール おかわりならもう欲しい 愛包ダンスホール どうぞ
Ai-pai Dance Hall, if you want seconds already... Ai-pai Dance Hall, here you go.

148
00:16:45,124 --> 00:16:48,024
さよならプリンセス 宙に舞っている
Goodbye, princess, dancing in the sky.

149
00:16:48,024 --> 00:16:51,624
眠り 沈む その姿は華やかな
Sleeping, sinking, that figure is so gorgeous.

150
00:16:52,024 --> 00:16:55,524
魅惑のハッピーエンド 私とさよならだ（はい！）
A captivating happy ending, it's goodbye to myself!

151
00:16:57,024 --> 00:17:04,024
[Title: さよならプリンセス]
[Title: Sayonara Princess]

152
00:17:06,124 --> 00:17:13,524
鏡の中独り縛られて 頭の中逃げ回る毎日です ずっと、ずっと
Bound alone inside the mirror, running around in my head every single day, always, always...

153
00:17:13,524 --> 00:17:21,024
だって私変われないし 夢もないし 口もないし つまらないし 可愛くもないし 分らないし 仕方ないし
Because I can't change, have no dreams, no voice, no fun, and I'm not even cute... I don't understand, can't help it...

154
00:17:21,024 --> 00:17:27,524
不意に気づいたらまるで 指輪が首輪になっていたんだ
When I suddenly realized, it was as if the ring had turned into a collar.

155
00:17:28,024 --> 00:17:34,524
壊れた大人の愛情なんだ 期待を蹴った私のことなんて 気にしないでね
It was a broken adult's affection. Don't worry about someone like me who kicked away expectations.

156
00:17:35,024 --> 00:17:44,524
さよならプリンセス 宙に舞っている 独り 浮かぶ その姿は華やかな 魅惑のハッピーエンド 私とさよならだ
Goodbye, princess, dancing in the sky. Alone, floating, that figure is a gorgeous, captivating happy ending, goodbye to myself.

157
00:17:45,024 --> 00:17:47,824
間抜けたプリンセス 過去とバイバイだ
Silly princess, bye-bye to the past.

158
00:17:48,024 --> 00:17:54,524
この際 何も 全てを燃やしてしまおう このまま宙を泳いで あの星になれたら
At this rate, let's burn everything away. If I could swim through the void like this and become that star...

159
00:17:55,024 --> 00:18:02,524
私、私とさよならだ 心の穴 妬み 渦巻いた 体の中 空回る毎日です ずっと、ずっと
Goodbye to myself, to me. Holes in my heart, envy swirling inside my body, spinning uselessly every single day, always, always...

160
00:18:03,024 --> 00:18:09,524
だってアナタ頭良いし 変わらないし 足長いし 面白いし 顔も可愛いし
Because you're so smart, unchanging, long-legged, funny, and your face is cute too...

161
00:18:13,024 --> 00:18:21,524
さり気ないし 仕方ないし 溢れるオーラはまるで キラキラ輝く安定剤ね
So effortless, can't help it. Your overflowing aura is like a sparkling, shining stabilizer...

162
00:18:21,524 --> 00:18:25,524
メロメロ私は面目無いね
I'm totally head over heels, feeling ashamed...

163
00:18:25,524 --> 00:18:30,024
古い昨日の私のことなんて 探さないでね
Don't go looking for someone like my old self from yesterday.

164
00:18:30,024 --> 00:18:35,524
さよならプリンセス 愛に酔っている（はい！） 独り 浮かぶ その姿は鮮やかな
Goodbye, princess, intoxicated by love! Alone, floating, that figure is vivid.

165
00:18:36,024 --> 00:18:41,524
理想のハッピーエンド 私とさよならだ さよならプリンセス 全てバイバイだ
An ideal happy ending, goodbye to myself. Goodbye, princess, bye-bye to everything.

166
00:18:41,524 --> 00:18:49,024
巡り 廻る 幸せに絡まる程 間抜けなハッピーエンド 可愛くなれたかな
Entangled in the spinning happiness, a foolish happy ending. I wonder if I managed to become cute.

167
00:18:49,024 --> 00:18:56,024
私、私は既に分かっていたんだ この世とさよならか？
I, I already knew it all along... Is this saying goodbye to this world?

168
00:19:09,024 --> 00:19:13,524
[Title: Mr. Showtime]

169
00:19:20,024 --> 00:19:28,024
ちょっと どうも こうも 煮え切らない とっちらかっちゃって まとまらない ひとりぼっちの舞台に響くモノローグ
Wait, somehow or other I'm indecisive, all scattered and unable to pull it together. A monologue echoing across a lonely stage...

170
00:19:30,024 --> 00:19:37,024
あれも これも 出来やしない？ 回る 回る 思考回路 ぐだって うだって いくほど 持て余す 精神
Can't I do this or that either? My thought circuits spin and spin. The more I slack off and stall, the more restless my mind gets.

171
00:19:38,024 --> 00:19:45,024
あっちこっち進んで 止まって 袋小路 in 迷宮？ 行き止まりでも 諦めない！ 翔ろ天！
Going here and there, stopping. A dead end in a labyrinth? Even at a dead end, don't give up! Soar to the heavens!

172
00:19:46,024 --> 00:19:51,024
なら ひとりぼっちじゃ つまらないでしょう カオスなメンバー集めて あの星を目指せ
Well, being all alone is no fun, right? Gather a chaotic crew and aim for that star!

173
00:19:52,024 --> 00:19:59,524
まるで掴めやしない 届きやしない 願い星まで 梯子をかけていざ登ろうか ドリーマーズ！
Up to the wishing star that we can never grasp or reach—let's set up a ladder and climb up, dreamers!

174
00:20:00,182 --> 00:20:03,232
まるで掴めやしない 届きやしない 願い星まで
Reaching out for the wish stars I can't quite grasp or touch—

175
00:20:03,482 --> 00:20:05,132
梯子をかけていざ登ろうか ドリーマーズ！
let's set up a ladder and climb up, dreamers!

176
00:20:05,132 --> 00:20:08,882
恐れはしない 怯みもしない 呆れるほどに
Not afraid, not hesitating, to an absurd degree—

177
00:20:08,882 --> 00:20:12,732
無謀な 愉快な 冒険譚 さぁ
a reckless, delightful adventure story, now then—

178
00:20:12,732 --> 00:20:15,932
止まれないまま it's showtime!
never stopping, it's showtime!

179
00:20:23,982 --> 00:20:27,232
ねえ 待って 待って おかしいな
Hey, wait, wait, something's strange—

180
00:20:27,232 --> 00:20:30,932
次の台詞が 飛んじゃった
my next line just flew right out of my head.

181
00:20:31,482 --> 00:20:34,932
迷子になった舞台に下りる幕
The curtain falls on a stage where I've lost my way.

182
00:20:34,932 --> 00:20:39,132
なんで？ どうして？ やるせない
Why? For what reason? So helpless—

183
00:20:39,132 --> 00:20:41,832
不発の拍手
unfulfilled applause.

184
00:20:41,832 --> 00:20:46,432
焦げ付いてく敗北の味 苦くてたまらない
The scorched taste of defeat is agonizingly bitter.

185
00:20:46,432 --> 00:20:50,982
あれこれ不安で 悩んで 遠回り？ 空回り？
Worried and anxious about this and that, taking the long way? Spinning our wheels?

186
00:20:50,982 --> 00:20:54,632
予定不調和の演目こそが 最高の人生
An unscripted program is the greatest life of all!

187
00:20:54,632 --> 00:20:57,682
なら 近道ばかりも 味気ないだろう？
After all, isn't taking only shortcuts rather dull?

188
00:20:57,682 --> 00:21:02,132
エンジン全開！ Go, goジェットコースターで
Engines full throttle! Go, go on a roller coaster,

189
00:21:02,132 --> 00:21:06,882
山も谷も全速！
racing full speed through mountains and valleys!

190
00:21:06,882 --> 00:21:11,882
てんで笑えやしない 救えやしない 不完全燃焼
Utterly unable to laugh or be saved, incomplete combustion—

191
00:21:11,882 --> 00:21:16,882
花火に乗せてまだ飛ばそうか チャレンジャーズ！
shall we send it soaring further on fireworks, challengers?

192
00:21:16,882 --> 00:21:19,432
昏い夜空も 温い涙も 吹き飛ばすように
To blow away both the gloomy night sky and lukewarm tears—

193
00:21:19,432 --> 00:21:21,082
光よ 音よ 慰めてね？ 顔を上げて show must go on
O light, O sound, comfort me? Lift your face, show must go on.

194
00:21:28,982 --> 00:21:32,732
凡な才の煩悩が 這う這うの体でゆく
The worldly desires of ordinary talent crawl away in a pitiful state,

195
00:21:32,732 --> 00:21:36,532
欺し欺してナルシスト 気張れや気取れ一等星
deceiving oneself like a narcissist. Brace up and put on airs, you first-magnitude star!

196
00:21:36,532 --> 00:21:39,532
かませ！ ハッタリも上等！ 自信過剰？
Let loose! Bluffing is top-tier! Overconfident?

197
00:21:39,532 --> 00:21:43,082
見切り発車 ブレブレ走行
Starting prematurely, running all over the place with shaky steering,

198
00:21:43,082 --> 00:21:46,882
大見得切り 大目玉 食らっても
even if you strike a grand pose and get chewed out,

199
00:21:46,882 --> 00:21:50,982
尽きぬ好奇心 止められやしない！
your endless curiosity cannot be stopped!

200
00:21:50,982 --> 00:21:54,632
止まれないまま it's showtime!
never stopping, it's showtime!

201
00:22:04,982 --> 00:22:09,682
語り尽くせない おもいで星を 詰め込んだ風船
Balloons stuffed with endless star-memories of tales we cannot tell enough,

202
00:22:09,682 --> 00:22:14,332
銀河を翔てゆく 夢を乗せて
carrying dreams as we soar across the galaxy.

203
00:22:14,332 --> 00:22:18,482
まだ終わらない 終わりたくない それでもいつかは
Still not ending, I don't want it to end, yet someday...

204
00:22:18,482 --> 00:22:21,832
閉園時間が来るまで
until closing time arrives—

205
00:22:21,832 --> 00:22:25,132
一層 踊り明かせ 歌い明かせ stardust parade
Dance until dawn, sing until dawn in a stardust parade!

206
00:22:25,132 --> 00:22:28,932
果てない夢 演じようか ドリーマーズ！
Shall we act out endless dreams, dreamers?!

207
00:22:28,932 --> 00:22:32,982
忘れやしない 嘆きやしない「別れ」じゃないから
We won't forget, we won't lament, because this isn't a "farewell."

208
00:22:32,982 --> 00:22:37,382
無謀な 愉快な 伝説を ah
A reckless, delightful legend, ah—

209
00:22:37,382 --> 00:22:41,532
破天荒型 step by stepで
with unconventional step by step,

210
00:22:41,532 --> 00:22:47,032
はちゃめちゃくちゃの ワンダホーイ！っと綴るのさ Mr. Showtime
spelling out a chaotic, wonderful-hey! Mr. Showtime.

211
00:22:59,532 --> 00:23:07,032
わあ、歌ったぞ！難しかったけど、楽しかったー！
Wow, we sang it! It was hard, but it was so fun!

212
00:23:07,532 --> 00:23:11,032
みんな来てくれたの？ありがとう！
Everyone came to see us? Thank you!

213
00:23:12,032 --> 00:23:19,532
お誕生日おめでとう！
Happy birthday!

214
00:23:20,032 --> 00:23:26,532
ありがとう！ありがとうなんだけどさ、どういうテンションなのこれ？
Thank you! Thank you, but... what kind of vibe is this?

215
00:23:27,032 --> 00:23:30,032
振り何やってさ、こういうテンションだっけ？
What was that choreography? Was this the vibe?

216
00:23:30,532 --> 00:23:35,032
そうなんだ。っていうかどんなんだと思ってたの？おいわいテンションなの？
Is that so? Wait, what did you think it was? A celebratory vibe?

217
00:23:35,532 --> 00:23:39,532
さてと...そうなの。アーニャちゃんは、何歳になったの？
Now then... Is that so? Anya-chan, how old did you turn?

218
00:23:41,032 --> 00:23:46,032
私は...2歳になったの！
I... turned 2 years old!

219
00:23:46,532 --> 00:23:52,532
えー！2歳なのー？そうだよ！あいすは、何歳なの？
Eh?! 2 years old?! That's right! IRyS, how old are you?

220
00:23:55,032 --> 00:23:56,532
え？アイリスは...
Eh? IRyS is...

221
00:23:56,532 --> 00:24:00,032
アイリス！アイリス！アイリス！
IRyS! IRyS! IRyS!

222
00:24:00,032 --> 00:24:07,032
まだ聞いてないから！何歳なの？
I haven't heard yet! How old are you?

223
00:24:07,532 --> 00:24:12,032
聞いてないから！何歳なの？
I haven't heard! How old are you?

224
00:24:13,032 --> 00:24:17,032
アイリスは...ハタチなの！
IRyS is... 20 years old!

225
00:24:22,532 --> 00:24:32,032
アイリスもありがとうな。アイリスもありがとうな！
Thank you too, IRyS. Thank you too, IRyS!

226
00:24:33,032 --> 00:24:36,032
私はもう消えます！
I'm disappearing already!

227
00:24:46,032 --> 00:25:00,072
ねえ、ミスターショウタイム4人で歌ったんですけれど、感想とか曲の感想とかでも...めちゃめちゃ難しかったんだから！
Hey, we sang "Mr. Showtime" as four people, but any impressions or thoughts on the song... It was so hard!

228
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:02,890
あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

229
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:02,890
あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

230
