あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

233
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:02,890
あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

234
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:02,890
あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

235
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:02,890
あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

236
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:02,890
あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

237
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:02,890
あ、あ、あ、あ
Ah, ah, ah, ah...

238
00:30:00,370 --> 00:30:03,460
アナタのVeil どうしても引き剝がして
No matter what, I'll tear away your veil...

239
00:30:04,000 --> 00:30:08,880
その深い（深い）瞳に別の色をのせたい
...and put a different color in those deep, deep eyes!

240
00:30:09,160 --> 00:30:14,660
老いた 知った 空振りも 今 蹴り飛ばして 駆けつけるから
Kicking away the aged, known misses, I'll rush over to you!

241
00:30:15,060 --> 00:30:18,060
あまねく導いてみせるから
Because I will guide you universally!

242
00:30:36,168 --> 00:30:40,468
倍々しても 元が何でもない
Even if multiplied, it started from nothing...

243
00:30:40,868 --> 00:30:44,968
私に成せることはないが
There's nothing I can accomplish...

244
00:30:45,268 --> 00:30:49,868
でも そうだ きっと 今はそれでも良いって
Even so, surely, that it's okay just like this now...

245
00:30:50,068 --> 00:30:53,968
青が頷き拡がる空から
From the sky where the blue nods and spreads...

246
00:30:54,268 --> 00:30:58,768
愛していたい 唄にしなきゃ始まらない
I want to love; if it's not turned into a song, nothing begins!

247
00:30:59,068 --> 00:31:03,068
歪なステップでもいい？ 今は君と踊っていたい
Even with a distorted step? I want to dance with you right now!

248
00:31:03,468 --> 00:31:07,868
ただ 生きるためのお呪いをそこに残した
I left behind a spell just to survive right there.

249
00:31:08,268 --> 00:31:12,668
命を追ってほしい 君と短く永い季節をたどって
I want you to chase life, tracing short and eternal seasons with you!

250
00:31:13,168 --> 00:31:17,168
倍々しても
Even if multiplied...

251
00:31:17,568 --> 00:31:21,568
元が何でもない私に出来ることはあるか？
Is there anything I can do, starting from nothing?

252
00:31:21,868 --> 00:31:26,568
このTempo そうだ こんな唄ならどうだ
This tempo—that's right, how about a song like this?

253
00:31:26,868 --> 00:31:31,068
正しくないけど丁度は良いかもネ
It might not be right, but maybe it's just right.

254
00:31:33,468 --> 00:31:40,568
もっと響かせて この未知に賭けて
Let it resonate even more, betting on this unknown path!

255
00:32:08,148 --> 00:32:13,548
[Title: ずうっといっしょ！ - Lyrics, Music: Tatsuya Kitani]

256
00:32:20,548 --> 00:32:23,948
